# Deploy — burjexprime.net (GitHub)

Code lives in **https://github.com/Naveedshehzad511/Burjex-complete-project**. Live site for this work is **burjexprime.net**.

Do **not** deploy until the user explicitly asks. When they do:

1. Push only intended files to GitHub `main` (skip reverted social-login UI).
2. Update server **`C:\Burjex-complete-project`** (git pull / hotpatch).
3. Restart **only** `burjex_net`:
   - `docker compose -p burjex_net -f deploy/docker-compose.github.yml --env-file deploy/.env.github`
   - recreate/restart matching `bxnet_*` services
4. **Never** run compose without `--env-file`.

| Changed | Redeploy |
|---|---|
| Django CRM | `bxnet_crm_web` |
| BTrader gateway / ws / engine | matching `bxnet_bt_*` |
| market-data | `bxnet_bt_market_data` |
| portal / admin static | `bxnet_caddy` or copy into compose volumes |

